graph TD
    Start[Start Pre-Implementation Analysis] --> A[Analyze Existing Codebase Context]
    A --> B[Detect Existing Modules and Related Controllers]
    B --> C[Detect Naming Collisions and Duplicate Logic]
    C --> D[Detect Missing Core Dependencies]
    D --> E[Detect Missing Database Migrations]
    E --> F[Detect Missing Permissions and Roles]
    F --> G[Detect Missing Events and Listeners]
    G --> H[Detect Missing Policies and Authorization Rules]
    H --> I[Map All Dependencies: Models, Services, Routes]
    I --> J[Identify Integration Points with Existing ERP]
    J --> K[Evaluate Tenant Isolation and Scope Impact]
    K --> L[Evaluate Audit Logging and Accounting Hooks]
    L --> M[Formulate Detailed Implementation Plan]
    M --> End[Analysis Complete - Ready for Implementation]
